# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# dist is a build artefact, but the directory itself must exist: //go:embed
# fails at compile time when it is missing, which would break `go test ./...`
# on a fresh clone.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-ssr
*.local

